  note    = {Dr. GRPO; names GRPO's length and difficulty biases},
  further = {no},
  tldr    = {Dr. GRPO fixes an optimization bias in GRPO that artificially inflates response length for incorrect outputs, improving token efficiency while maintaining reasoning performance on a 7B model.},
  tldr-zh = {Dr. GRPO 修正了组相对策略优化（GRPO）中人为拉长错误回答长度的优化偏差，在保持推理性能的同时提升了词元效率。}
